# Repro: doc/08_tracking/bug/seed_jit_cannot_resolve_text_dot_from_char_code_2026-09-04.md
# The builtin text statics `text.from_char_code` must route
# to the canonical runtime ABI under the JIT (LLVM already did). Before: the
# Cranelift JIT emitted a call to the dotted name and the process died with
# SIGSEGV (rc 139) and printed nothing.
# Expected: fc A
fn main():
    val s = text.from_char_code(65)
    print "fc {s}"
